<p>Make a painful strike dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150%</acronym> weapon damage that increases the duration of up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 2, 3</acronym> negative effect(s) on the target by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 5</acronym> turns. For each negative effect extended this way, the duration of a beneficial effect is reduced by the same amount, possibly canceling it.</p>